        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Davida wakamwaambila kuti, Utayoowi pe, nkaambo njanda kukucitila cabuuya nkaambo ka-Jonatani uso. Njookuboozezya myuunda yoonse ya-Saulo uso, alimwi uyoolya insima kulindime mazuba oonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
