                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Ziba wakaambila mwami kuti, Mebo ndemulanda wako nzoocita zintu zyoonse buyo nzyandilailila mwami simalelaangu Pele Mefibosete wakali kulya kutafule lya-Davida mbuli umwi wabana bamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
